msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The Mutiny variant does not only apply the rules exposed in the previous "
"section.\n"
"For asynchronous methods, it also provides:"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"`xAndAwait()` methods - blocks the caller thread until the outcome is "
"received. In the case of a failure, throws a `RuntimeException`"
msgstr ""

